{"id":15282120493,"name":"Poly Dash (Geometry Dash)","desc":"This game is still in development. Please suggest feedback instead of disliking the game! 👍\n🎵 Click to jump and fly across obstacles to the music!\n\n🎮 Controls:\n- Press Q to quit a level\n- Tab to pause\n- Z/X (L1/R1 on console) To place/remove checkpoints (practice mode only)\n- A/D to change playback speed (temporary)\n\n🛠️ The editor is currently in beta. Expect gradual updates over time.\nEditor functions best on PC with partial support for mobile.\n\n🖥️ Supported Platforms: PC, Mobile, Console\n\nGame mechanics taken from Geometry Dash by RobTop (Robert Topala).\nAll game assets are completely separate from Geometry Dash.\nAll in-game audio belong to their respective artists.","path":"/game/15282120493-poly-dash","slug":"15282120493-poly-dash","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2b4b9100cc519b10e6192acb912590c2e4857e9074dab626b3958d39dcc3db96.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b5febdec28ced543aa5d47b6bcf737d3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":330,"visitor":124407986,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-03T01:32:21.548Z","creator":{"name":"team exc","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"67ede525f337236e461c88cd","title":"no die","game":{"_id":"67ede525f337236e461c88ca","gameId":15282120493,"name":"Poly Dash (Geometry Dash)","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2b4b9100cc519b10e6192acb912590c2e4857e9074dab626b3958d39dcc3db96.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b5febdec28ced543aa5d47b6bcf737d3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"15282120493-poly-dash","path":"/game/15282120493-poly-dash","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2b4b9100cc519b10e6192acb912590c2e4857e9074dab626b3958d39dcc3db96.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b5febdec28ced543aa5d47b6bcf737d3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":15282120493},"slug":"Poly-Dash-(Geometry-Dash)-no-die-33943","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":11821,"executes":103,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":true,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8e1fc8de40c4f6ec01829028a796d8a3/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8e1fc8de40c4f6ec01829028a796d8a3/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8e1fc8de40c4f6ec01829028a796d8a3/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8e1fc8de40c4f6ec01829028a796d8a3/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter"},"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-04-03T01:32:21.548Z","updatedAt":"2025-04-03T01:32:21.548Z","lastBump":"2025-04-03T01:32:21.548Z","script":"getgenv().deletewhendupefound = true\nlocal lib = loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://rawscripts.net/raw/Universal-Script-Lib-18698\"))()\nlib.makelib(\"Poly Dash (2AreYouMental110)\")\nlocal main = lib.maketab(\"Main\")\nlocal nodie = false\nlib.maketoggle(\"no die\",main,function(bool)\n    nodie = bool\nend)\nlib.makelabel(\"Turn off no die before entering levels\",main)\nlocal req = require(game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\").Classes.Player)\nlocal currentplr = nil\nlocal recentlydied = 0\nlocal checkpoint = nil\nlocal origkill = req.Kill\nreq.Kill = function(self)\n    if nodie then\n        self.x += 25\n        if self.gravity == 1 and self.y >= 15 then\n            self.y += 25\n        else\n            self.y -= 25\n        end\n        currentplr = self\n        recentlydied = 1\n        error(\"\")\n    else\n        if self.icon then\n            self.icon:Destroy()\n        end\n        self.alive = false\n    end\nend\nlib.ondestroyedfunc = function()\n    req.Kill = origkill\n    nodie = false\nend","features":"wont work on Solara (maybe)\nno die","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink"